{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siaty's Return is a challenging slow-paced bossgame inspired by both solo games and MMOs, featuring an innovative combination-based gameplay. Combine the three Facets of destruction, resilience and movement into powerful abilities to defeat your corrupted creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/7f0da60aeb4e44f5f0b06e4b38f455ce.poster.avif?t=1769779836\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/7f0da60aeb4e44f5f0b06e4b38f455ce.webm?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/7f0da60aeb4e44f5f0b06e4b38f455ce.mp4?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master a deep combination-based gameplay  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siaty wields the 3 Facets of destruction, resilience and movement. In battle, these Facets can either be used separately or merged to create a wide variety of abilities. Long range attack, close range attack, dash forward, backdash, protective shield, teleportation, timed defense, ... Master Siaty's versatility and find your way to overcome whatever is in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/5ab0bb30841f90f0365962dfecdc8d2a.poster.avif?t=1769779836\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/5ab0bb30841f90f0365962dfecdc8d2a.webm?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/5ab0bb30841f90f0365962dfecdc8d2a.mp4?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A slow-paced action game focusing on anticipation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing an ability takes time, so you better plan ahead. Reflexes alone won't lead you to victory. But if you observe your enemies well, you will always have the right tool ready at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/e887b7c87c2b887e95b03a83e53ce0d6.poster.avif?t=1769779836\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/e887b7c87c2b887e95b03a83e53ce0d6.webm?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949820/extras/e887b7c87c2b887e95b03a83e53ce0d6.mp4?t=1769779836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect From Siaty's Return </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light-hearted yet challenging bossgame made with love by two developers  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original gameplay where you mix Facets on the fly during battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deliberate fighting system emphasizing anticipation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth tutorial including 2 bosses to help you master Siaty's moveset </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different bosses in total with unique mechanics and 2 difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional secondary objectives for each fight </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light background story unfolding as you progress through bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between 3h and 5h of gameplay </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > PLEASE NOTE THAT SIATY'S RETURN IS BEST PLAYED WITH A GAMEPAD </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/3bc124b7ea24a57953e5d5ab1e32c8cc2a25187e.jpg"},{"name":"Sparring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/34adf488ce22ca09feaa327b9e78872d349e4b21.jpg"},{"name":"Warmed up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/a1ee0c68f856d272d012873a4cdb42d351de5a5f.jpg"},{"name":"Back into shape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/4216be7aabe4bcd5333c263b5d3de7722e78c31e.jpg"},{"name":"Toxicity: captured","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/49e00603499447cda2a4ba9c90a3315c36859390.jpg"},{"name":"Toxicity: speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/996c4fe30200031bca1bbbf302319ebb8a08fb13.jpg"},{"name":"Toxicity: interrupt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/bad08d708d8fcfd64c6a7ac14068bbb6a220fe7e.jpg"},{"name":"Toxicity: damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/5a7fa4760458d9393273700a9aa581dfa7b40c74.jpg"},{"name":"Toxicity: mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/7b912ee91ae2b6aa30468354fdd47d6bfa6ed37e.jpg"},{"name":"Superiority: captured","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2949820/ad34ca918752ed30c1c316cff7856b2af452caed.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949820?t=1769779836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.stea